# Captured / derived screenshot trees — regenerated every run, never committed:
#   current, verify -> the reproducibility gate;  review -> the pre-push guard's
#   local drift gallery.
shots/current/
shots/verify/
shots/review/

# The committed baseline is the tiny digest manifest only — shots/baseline/*.sha256
